cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software, please cite its repository and version. The bundled evidence examples are synthetic, not ecological observations."
title: "EcoCausal-Reasoner: An offline provenance-aware scientific evidence prototype"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tat
    given-names: Sana
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research-software prototype for lexical evidence retrieval,
  deterministic multi-role orchestration, provenance-aware RDF/SPARQL candidate
  relations, and synthetic causal and world-model analysis. Optional
  transformer, dense retrieval, LLM and LoRA adapters are not validated by
  the packaged offline benchmark.
